      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# ⚛️ Basic Physics\n\n## The rules beneath everyday reality\n\nPhysics explains how **matter**, **energy**, **space**, and **time** interact, from a falling apple to an orbiting planet.\n\n### Explore the foundations\n\n**Motion** • **Forces** • **Energy** • **Matter** • **Waves** • **Electricity**\n\n> Observe. Measure. Predict.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1784992398873,
