      "data": {
        "markdown": "## 🧲 Forces\n\nA force is a push or pull that can change motion.\n\nNewton's second law connects force, mass, and acceleration:\n\n`F = ma`\n\nCommon forces include gravity, friction, tension, and the normal force.",
