        "markdown": "## ⚡ Energy\n\nEnergy is the ability to produce change or perform work.\n\n- **Kinetic energy:** energy of motion\n- **Potential energy:** stored energy\n- **Thermal energy:** microscopic particle motion\n\nEnergy changes form but is conserved.",
