      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## 💡 Electricity\n\nElectricity involves electric charge and its movement.\n\n- **Current:** flow of charge\n- **Voltage:** electric potential difference\n- **Resistance:** opposition to current\n\n`voltage = current × resistance`",
